DETECTION_SPEC=spec("SFT-CHEM-ANALYTICAL-DETECTION-QUANTIFICATION-004","Fold detection and quantification boundary law","Complete blank and low-level supports force method-bounded distinguishability, explicit error custody, and separate detection and quantification classes or structural absence.",A4_DEPS,A4_DIMS,A4_RESULT,A4_WITNESSES,"SFT-EXP-CHEM-ANALYTICAL-DETECTION-QUANTIFICATION-004","complete-detection-quantification-boundary-vector",A4_TARGETS,"Eight dimensions exhaust identity, blank, levels, detection, errors, quantification, absence and extension.","One blank support and one low-level support supply the first boundary test.","Every successor retains prior classifications and adds a complete level row.")
SELECTIVITY_SPEC=spec("SFT-CHEM-ANALYTICAL-SELECTIVITY-INTERFERENCE-005","Fold analytical selectivity and interference-matrix law","Held analyte and complete interferent baselines and mixtures force exact method-bounded response distinction, interference side/distance or structural coincidence, retaining every error row.",A5_DEPS,A5_DIMS,A5_RESULT,A5_WITNESSES,"SFT-EXP-CHEM-ANALYTICAL-SELECTIVITY-INTERFERENCE-005","complete-analytical-selectivity-interference-vector",A5_TARGETS,"Eight dimensions exhaust identity, matrix, baselines, mixtures, comparison, selectivity, adverse custody and extension.","One analyte and one interferent baseline/mixture supply the first comparison.","Every successor adds one interferent while preserving every earlier row.")
